  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-bootstrap-requirements/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow`.\n\nThe file opens with the front matter and the `# Bootstrap requirements` title. Its first section, `## Workflow`, is `section[Bootstrap%20requirements]/section[Workflow]`. Every other section follows it: `Inventories`, `Proposing requirements`, `Tagging`, `Report` and `Gotchas`.\n\nThe text before `## Workflow` is a short intro paragraph and a pointer to the habeas skill's coverage guidance. Both sit under the H1 title and are not a separate section. The requirement says \"before any other section\", and no heading precedes the workflow, so the file meets it. The other bundled skills put `## Workflow` first in the same way.\n\nThe workflow is a list of numbered steps, `- [ ] 1.` through `- [ ] 9.`, with sub-steps 7a to 7c. That makes them ordered steps.\n\nThere are no violation-query matches to judge. No gap found.",
